# 詞: 銀包

1. 佢喺抽屜入面搵到一個銀包，裡面裝滿咗硬幣。 (He found a silver pouch in the drawer, filled with coins.)
2. 呢個銀包係我阿媽留低嘅，我唔敢亂動。 (This silver pouch was left by my mum, so I dare not touch it.)
3. 佢用銀包裝住零用錢，方便每日出街用。 (He used a silver pouch to carry his pocket money, making it convenient for daily outings.)
4. 銀包嘅設計好精緻，每一條線都好細緻。 (The design of the silver pouch is very exquisite, with every line carefully crafted.)
5. 佢喺市場買咗一個銀包，用嚟裝零錢。 (He bought a silver pouch at the market to hold loose change.)
6. 銀包唔係普通嘅錢包，佢有特別嘅意義。 (The silver pouch is not an ordinary wallet; it has special meaning.)
7. 佢將銀包放喺安全嘅地方，怕有人偷走。 (He placed the silver pouch in a safe place, afraid someone would steal it.)
8. 銀包嘅顏色閃閃發光，好吸引人。 (The silver pouch shines with a sparkling color, very attractive.)
9. 佢用銀包裝住重要嘅文件，確保佢安全。 (He used the silver pouch to store important documents to ensure their safety.)
10. 銀包係佢嘅心愛物件，佢唔會輕易畀人借。 (The silver pouch is his cherished item, and he won't easily lend it to others.) [end of text]


